-// constants/mockRecipes.ts
-//
-// Built-in Pinoy Recipes content.
-//
-// The app is designed to read live data from Firestore (see services/recipeService.ts),
-// but a brand-new Firebase project starts with an empty `recipes` collection, which
-// means the app would otherwise show nothing at all. This file supplies real,
-// ready-to-use recipe content so the app is fully populated out of the box.
-//
-// recipeService.ts automatically falls back to this content whenever Firestore
-// is empty, unreachable, or not yet configured. Once real recipes are added via
-// the Admin > Manage Recipes screen, that live content is used instead.
-//
-// Placeholder images use Lorem Picsum (stable, license-free placeholder photos).
-// Replace heroImageUrl with real food photography via the admin image uploader
-// whenever you're ready.
